00:31:48.620 --> 00:31:53.293
in what animal or in humans it originated.

00:31:54.180 --> 00:31:57.410
Okay and then also the
receptor-binding domain is

00:31:57.410 --> 00:32:02.010
not optimized to bind for
the human ACE2 receptor,

00:32:02.010 --> 00:32:05.410
suggesting that it's not engineered,

00:32:05.410 --> 00:32:10.353
and it also lacks any
signature of loud engineering.

00:32:12.600 --> 00:32:15.420
Okay, and just to review,

