00:33:02.400 --> 00:33:04.530
So this is often difficult,

00:33:04.530 --> 00:33:09.200
mostly because of this
incompleteness of the genomes,

00:33:09.200 --> 00:33:12.460
and so this is something that
researchers are still trying

00:33:12.460 --> 00:33:17.100
to do is determine the
original most recent ancestor

00:33:17.100 --> 00:33:18.643
of this virus.

00:33:19.700 --> 00:33:23.130
And then these hypothetical
models that I talked about,

00:33:23.130 --> 00:33:26.280
the protein structure not being optimal.

00:33:26.280 --> 00:33:30.080
These are being confirmed in living cells

00:33:31.080 --> 00:33:32.110
in using these models

00:33:32.110 --> 00:33:36.270
to predict those different
more efficient structures

00:33:36.270 --> 00:33:38.240
and a lot of these,

00:33:38.240 --> 00:33:39.490
a lot of what is known

00:33:39.490 --> 00:33:44.223
from the predictions are
turning out to be accurate.

00:33:45.470 --> 00:33:50.470
Okay, and so why is this kind
of question important other

00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:55.840
than knowing that it wasn't
an act of bioterrorism.

00:33:55.840 --> 00:33:58.410
This research can help
in many different ways.

