So this could prevent future transfers

00:34:07.990 --> 00:34:10.350
of the virus from animals to humans,

00:34:10.350 --> 00:34:11.330
but it also could help

00:34:11.330 --> 00:34:14.880
us stop spreading the virus in animals.

00:34:14.880 --> 00:34:19.880
So that might be important way
to stop spreading the virus,

00:34:21.780 --> 00:34:24.510
but we can also track
using the same techniques

00:34:24.510 --> 00:34:28.240
to track the ongoing
