another using the same kind

00:34:37.720 --> 00:34:42.003
of techniques of this sequence alignment.

00:34:42.860 --> 00:34:47.050
And then lastly these protein models can

00:34:47.050 --> 00:34:49.490
also help give us information

00:34:49.490 --> 00:34:52.210
about what areas of the protein to target

00:34:52.210 --> 00:34:54.700
when we create drugs or vaccines,

00:34:54.700 --> 00:34:59.700
and so that's also very
important to think about.

